},{"code":"Messaging","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" capability, pass an initialized "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DefaultMessagingFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" here."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"messagingFactory"},{"name":"locale","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional locale override (e.g. “en-US”) to use instead of the device’s language."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An empty string or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" uses the device’s language. The value is trimmed and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"canonicalized before use, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"EN\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"En\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are equivalent and ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en_US\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accepted as ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"en-US\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"code":["    The locale is fixed for the lifetime of the returned instance. Passing a different `locale` for an","    already initialized `channelKey` has no effect - call `Zendesk.invalidate()` first, then `initialize`","    with the new locale.","","    Backend content — bot replies, settings and campaigns — follows this locale, as does the","    UIKit messaging interface (labels, buttons, error messages, VoiceOver descriptions, dates and","    plural forms). Lookup falls back from an exact match (`\"en-AU\"`) to the closest available","    translation (`\"en-GB\"`) and finally to the SDK's built-in English. Your app's own string","    overrides in `Bundle.main` continue to take precedence for the chosen locale.","","    Some things deliberately keep following the device: layout *direction*, Help Center article","    *content*, the Zendesk Voice SDK interface, and regional formatting (calendar, number separators,","    file-size units)."],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null}]},{"name":"completionHandler","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A block that takes a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Result","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" enum type. In the case of a success, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Zendesk","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance will be returned, in the case of a failure an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Error"},{"text":" type.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"aside","name":"Attention","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method must complete successfully before ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Zendesk.instance"},{"text":" can be called.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"After a successful call has been made, calling it again with the same ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"channelKey"},{"text":" will succeed immediately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without performing a network call.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/zendesksdk\/zendesk\/initialize(withchannelkey:messagingfactory:locale:completionhandler:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Initializes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Zendesk"},{"text":" for the given ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"channelKey"},{"type":"text","text":". A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MessagingFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" can be optionally passed here"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to add the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Messaging"},{"type":"text","text":" capability. This method is an asynchronous call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that retrieves settings from the network that calls the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"comple